{"id":"selinuxexeccon.8","n":"selinuxexeccon","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"libselinux-utils","ver":"3.6-3.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/l/libselinux-utils-3.6-3.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/selinuxexeccon.8.gz","sha256":"0903fc2340c50a16178e8260dd6fe1f48578cf604088eb91f8aa591b441b1127","date":"14 May 2011","origin":"dwalsh@redhat.com"},"u":{"pkg":"selinux-utils","ver":"3.3-1build2","repo":"jammy/universe","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/universe/libs/libselinux/selinux-utils_3.3-1build2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/selinuxexeccon.8.gz","sha256":"3448dd1d7a76343e384c627cbf9c05b410b276953c3ad60110774f40b7ccc734","date":"14 May 2011","origin":"dwalsh@redhat.com"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"report SELinux context used for this executable","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>selinuxexeccon - report SELinux context used for this executable</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>selinuxexeccon</b> <i>command</i> [<i>fromcon</i>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>selinuxexeccon</b> reports the SELinux process context for the specified command from the specified context or the current context.</p>"],["EXAMPLE","<pre># selinuxexeccon /usr/bin/passwd \nstaff_u:staff_r:passwd_t:s0-s0:c0.c1023\n# selinuxexeccon /usr/sbin/sendmail system_u:system_r:httpd_t:s0\nsystem_u:system_r:system_mail_t:s0</pre>"],["AUTHOR","<p>This manual page was written by Dan Walsh &lt;dwalsh@redhat.com&gt;.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>secon</b>(8)</p>"]]}